   local="Baddi is an industrial town first and a residential one second. Most homes are rented flats and floors close to the units in Baddi, Barotiwala and Jharmajri, along with company accommodation and staff colonies. Many tenants arrive with little furniture and leave with a full household a few years later. Truck and tanker traffic on the Baddi to Nalagarh road is heavy at shift changes, and the Sirsa river crossings can be slow in heavy rain, so loading is timed around both.",
