   local="Karnal is a planned city with HUDA sectors, older colonies like Model Town, and a crowded market belt around Mughal Canal. Independent houses with a car porch are common, which makes loading easier than in most cities. NH44 passes along the city, so long-distance trucks join the highway within minutes, but the highway service lanes get congested at the city entry points in the evening. The surrounding area is a rice and wheat belt, and many families have a house in town and land in the villages around Gharaunda, Taraori and Indri.",
   areas=["Model Town","Sector 6","Sector 7","Sector 13","Sector 14","Sector 32","Mughal Canal","Kunjpura Road","Ram Nagar","NDRI area","Gharaunda","Taraori","Indri","Nilokheri"],
   routes=["Karnal to Delhi","Karnal to Gurugram","Karnal to Chandigarh","Karnal to Jaipur","Karnal to Noida","Karnal to Bengaluru"],
