   intro="Service families and residents still search for VRL Packers and Movers Pathankot, and today that means 1st VRL Packers and Movers. Pathankot is about 110 km from our own Jammu office and around 250 km from our Panchkula head office. Moves in Pathankot are carried out by a verified partner team, with the planning and paperwork handled by our coordinator.",
   local="Pathankot sits where Punjab meets Jammu and Kashmir and Himachal Pradesh. NH44 runs north from here towards Jammu, the road to Dalhousie and Dharamshala climbs east into the hills, and the Kangra Valley narrow-gauge railway starts at Pathankot. The Mamun cantonment and the Air Force station make service transfers a large share of moves. Civilian homes are spread across the town, along the Dhangu, Dalhousie and Mission roads, and towards Sujanpur and Madhopur. Summer is hot, and the monsoon in July and August is heavy across the foothills.",
   areas=["Mamun Cantt","Sujanpur","Dhangu Road","Dalhousie Road","Mission Road","Chakki Bank","Madhopur","Shahpur Kandi","Jugial","Sarna","Nangal Bhur","Gharota"],
